2️⃣ Uvicorn (ASGI)
✅ Hardened Command
uvicorn myapp:app \
  --workers 4 \
  --loop uvloop \
  --http httptools \
  --proxy-headers \
  --forwarded-allow-ips="*" \
  --interface asgi3 \
  --timeout-keep-alive 15 \
  --uds /tmp/uvicorn.sock

🔎 Explanation of Key Flags

--workers 4 → Multi-process workers.

--loop uvloop & --http httptools → High-performance event loop and parser.

--proxy-headers → Trust headers only from your reverse proxy.

--uds → Unix domain socket.

--timeout-keep-alive 15 → Avoid keeping long idle connections.

⚠️ Do not use --reload in production.

