3️⃣ Hypercorn (ASGI)
✅ Hardened Command
hypercorn myapp:app \
  --bind unix:/tmp/hypercorn.sock \
  --workers 4 \
  --access-log /var/log/hypercorn/access.log \
  --error-log /var/log/hypercorn/error.log \
  --worker-class uvloop \
  --keep-alive 15

🔎 Explanation of Key Flags

--bind unix:/tmp/hypercorn.sock → Secure socket binding.

--workers 4 → Multiple processes.

--worker-class uvloop → Async optimized workers.

--keep-alive 15 → Drop idle connections fast.

⚠️ Do not run with --reload.

