4️⃣ Waitress (WSGI)
✅ Hardened Command
waitress-serve \
  --listen=unix:/tmp/waitress.sock \
  --threads=4 \
  --ident='' \
  --connection-limit=100 \
  --channel-timeout=30 \
  myapp:wsgi_app

🔎 Explanation of Key Flags

--listen=unix:/tmp/waitress.sock → Unix socket for Nginx.

--threads=4 → Thread pool size.

--ident='' → Hide server banner.

--connection-limit → Prevent too many open sockets.

--channel-timeout=30 → Timeout idle connections.

⚠️ Do not use in debug mode.

