Development vs Production Comparison
Feature / Flag	Development (Safe)	Production (Safe)
--reload	✅ Local only	❌ Never use
Debug mode	✅ Local only	❌ Never use
Binding	127.0.0.1:8000	Unix socket or proxy
Logging	Debug/Info	Info/Error only
Workers	1	≥ 2–4 per CPU core
User Privileges	Root (local)	Non-root only
Security Headers	Optional	✅ Mandatory (via proxy)

_____________

✅ Final Security Checklist

 Never run with debug or --reload in production

 Use Unix sockets with reverse proxy (Nginx, Caddy, HAProxy)

 Drop privileges after binding (--user, --group)

 Enforce request and connection limits

 Structured logs + log rotation

 Workers per CPU core (2–4)

 Apply security headers at proxy level

 Monitor logs & alerts for anomalies


